      "evidence": "Candidate prompt added a new \u201CPreserve Editorial Intent from the Synthesis\u201D section. Narrative mean score fell from 6.00 to 4.00/10; Compose mean fell from 5.67 to 3.33/10. All three candidate Narrative runs subordinated company identity/audience and made orchestration central; all candidate runs introduced unsupported claims and failed the D (factual/editorial restraint) gate. Decision: candidate not promoted; production prompt restored byte-for-byte."
    },
