      "audience": "Readers working on editorial prompt experiments",
      "rationale": "The contrast between the intended safeguard and the recorded output gives a concrete account of why this candidate was not promoted. The small, non-contemporaneous samples, variation in earlier outputs and possible backend changes limit attribution.",
      "evidence": "Run scores: Narrative averaged 6.00 versus 4.00 and Compose 5.67 versus 3.33, baseline versus candidate. Every candidate Narrative run made orchestration central. The report records the non-promotion, the tension in baseline Synthesis, and the three-run limit."
    }
  ]
